## The Quay

::bg{location="skerry_village" time="day"}
::music{action="change" mood="sad" volume="down"}
@narrator: Twelve houses, a chapel, the post office and Hollis's bar, all turned away from the sea like people refusing to look at something.
@narrator: At the end of the quay, a rusted mooring ring. A short end of rope still hangs from it, chafed to a brush.
@inspector{mono,when="holds('suspect', ['tobias'])"}: Everyone here has already decided Tobias Crane did something. I have not.
@inspector{mono,when="holds('cleared', ['tobias'])"}: Tobias was on Hollis's end stool all night. Whatever happened out there, it did not happen by his hand.
